    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Investigate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate what happened to the groundskeeper and why the Greehouse was shut down by examining environmental clues and interpreting the psychic visions you experience.   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/66bcf27864bb74e85d569b3c0c0e2b8e.poster.avif?t=1755308993\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/66bcf27864bb74e85d569b3c0c0e2b8e.webm?t=1755308993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/66bcf27864bb74e85d569b3c0c0e2b8e.mp4?t=1755308993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the compound and find your way out of each area. There are gardens, eerie corridors, labyrinths, strange art galleries, and more. For each newly visited area, your character will take a photo. Consult the photo album to help track your journey and ensure nothing is missed.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/1a121580176bce46352930b91085272b.poster.avif?t=1755308993\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/1a121580176bce46352930b91085272b.webm?t=1755308993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/1a121580176bce46352930b91085272b.mp4?t=1755308993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wander Alone or Activate Entities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a haunting walk filled with beauty and dread or enable each entity type and jump scares individually to customise your experience. Fend off venomous insects with bug spray. Encounter ghosts, some may help you or attack you. If you see the Groundskeeper... run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/ad7efff8aab615836730a30526ee2d37.poster.avif?t=1755308993\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/ad7efff8aab615836730a30526ee2d37.webm?t=1755308993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/ad7efff8aab615836730a30526ee2d37.mp4?t=1755308993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics and perspective puzzles create the path needed to move forward.\u00a0Some puzzles are random and change each time you play. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/542c36f29e182ad0914f183b39a99038.poster.avif?t=1755308993\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/542c36f29e182ad0914f183b39a99038.webm?t=1755308993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/542c36f29e182ad0914f183b39a99038.mp4?t=1755308993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The levels are vast, and like an open world, there is no loading between them which keeps you immersed from start to finish. Everything is designed to feel real and make you believe like you are there: the sound of the wind, your footsteps on various surfaces. Water ripples and slows you down as you walk through it. Foliage bends and rustles as you brush past it.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/bea4c6361c87e12278c8b3457fe0cb65.poster.avif?t=1755308993\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/bea4c6361c87e12278c8b3457fe0cb65.webm?t=1755308993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/bea4c6361c87e12278c8b3457fe0cb65.mp4?t=1755308993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Change the Weather</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The world of GREENHOUSE is surreal and paranormal. Pick up umbrellas, beach balls or sunglasses to change the weather. Make it rain, hail or shine to match the mood you want. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/b143e84150e3581956266505f1289fe7.poster.avif?t=1755308993\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/b143e84150e3581956266505f1289fe7.webm?t=1755308993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/b143e84150e3581956266505f1289fe7.mp4?t=1755308993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Investigate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate what happened to the groundskeeper and why the Greehouse was shut down by examining environmental clues and interpreting the psychic visions you experience.   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/66bcf27864bb74e85d569b3c0c0e2b8e.poster.avif?t=1755308993\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/66bcf27864bb74e85d569b3c0c0e2b8e.webm?t=1755308993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/66bcf27864bb74e85d569b3c0c0e2b8e.mp4?t=1755308993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the compound and find your way out of each area. There are gardens, eerie corridors, labyrinths, strange art galleries, and more. For each newly visited area, your character will take a photo. Consult the photo album to help track your journey and ensure nothing is missed.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/1a121580176bce46352930b91085272b.poster.avif?t=1755308993\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/1a121580176bce46352930b91085272b.webm?t=1755308993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/1a121580176bce46352930b91085272b.mp4?t=1755308993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wander Alone or Activate Entities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a haunting walk filled with beauty and dread or enable each entity type and jump scares individually to customise your experience. Fend off venomous insects with bug spray. Encounter ghosts, some may help you or attack you. If you see the Groundskeeper... run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/ad7efff8aab615836730a30526ee2d37.poster.avif?t=1755308993\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/ad7efff8aab615836730a30526ee2d37.webm?t=1755308993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/ad7efff8aab615836730a30526ee2d37.mp4?t=1755308993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics and perspective puzzles create the path needed to move forward.\u00a0Some puzzles are random and change each time you play. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/542c36f29e182ad0914f183b39a99038.poster.avif?t=1755308993\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/542c36f29e182ad0914f183b39a99038.webm?t=1755308993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/542c36f29e182ad0914f183b39a99038.mp4?t=1755308993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The levels are vast, and like an open world, there is no loading between them which keeps you immersed from start to finish. Everything is designed to feel real and make you believe like you are there: the sound of the wind, your footsteps on various surfaces. Water ripples and slows you down as you walk through it. Foliage bends and rustles as you brush past it.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/bea4c6361c87e12278c8b3457fe0cb65.poster.avif?t=1755308993\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/bea4c6361c87e12278c8b3457fe0cb65.webm?t=1755308993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/bea4c6361c87e12278c8b3457fe0cb65.mp4?t=1755308993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Change the Weather</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The world of GREENHOUSE is surreal and paranormal. Pick up umbrellas, beach balls or sunglasses to change the weather. Make it rain, hail or shine to match the mood you want. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/b143e84150e3581956266505f1289fe7.poster.avif?t=1755308993\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/b143e84150e3581956266505f1289fe7.webm?t=1755308993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/b143e84150e3581956266505f1289fe7.mp4?t=1755308993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
